## 2. Original Portfolio Scaffolding & 3D WebGL Implementation
The visual portfolio scaffolding and 3D chip teardown concept originate from a public repository authored by **Chinmay Mahananda**. Because the source repository was published publicly on GitHub without an explicit standalone open-source license file, default copyright law and GitHub's Terms of Service (Section D.4, License Grant to Other Users for public repositories and forks) apply.
- Copyright (c) 2026 Chinmay Mahananda. All original template rights reserved.
- Reproduced, transformed, and adapted under GitHub Public Repository terms and fair academic/personal attribution.
- This notice clarifies that adding an MIT License to new modifications does not retroactively alter the original author's copyright over the underlying template scaffolding.

